{"line":"T35.U.01","text":"Wie fremd sind wir einander, nach deinem Bauchgefühl? Empirische Daten hast du natürlich nicht, aber setz mich, dich, Marilyn Monroe, Alan Turing, Lieutenant Commander Data, HAL, die Schwarmkönigin, die Teins und jeden anderen Geist, der dir oder mir bekannt sein könnte, auf eine einzige Dimension. Dann sag mir, was du über die Unterschiede zwischen ihnen vermutest. Nimm einen höherdimensionalen Raum der Geister, wenn du eine Konzeptualisierung hast, die dir lieber ist.","lufs":-18.58,"alignment":{"characters":["W","i","e"," ","f","r","e","m","d"," ","s","i","n","d"," ","w","i","r"," ","e","i","n","a","n","d","e","r",","," ","n","a","c","h"," ","d","e","i","n","e","m"," ","B","a","u","c","h","g","e","f","ü","h","l","?"," ","E","m","p","i","r","i","s","c","h","e"," ","D","a","t","e","n"," ","h","a","s","t"," ","d","u"," ","n","a","t","ü","r","l","i","c","h"," ","n","i","c","h","t",","," ","a","b","e","r"," ","s","e","t","z"," ","m","i","c","h",","," ","d","i","c","h",","," ","M","a","r","i","l","y","n"," ","M","o","n","r","o","e",","," ","A","l","a","n"," ","T","u","r","i","n","g",","," ","L","i","e","u","t","e","n","a","n","t"," ","C","o","m","m","a","n","d","e","r"," ","D","a","t","a",","," ","H","A","L",","," ","d","i","e"," ","S","c","h","w","a","r","m","k","ö","n","i","g","i","n",","," ","d","i","e"," ","T","e","i","n","s"," ","u","n","d"," ","j","e","d","e","n"," ","a","n","d","e","r","e","n"," ","G","e","i","s","t",","," ","d","e","r"," ","d","i","r"," ","o","d","e","r"," ","m","i","r"," ","b","e","k","a","n","n","t"," ","s","e","i","n"," ","k","ö","n","n","t","e",","," ","a","u","f"," ","e","i","n","e"," ","e","i","n","z","i","g","e"," ","D","i","m","e","n","s","i","o","n","."," ","D","a","n","n"," ","s","a","g"," ","m","i","r",","," ","w","a","s"," ","d","u"," ","ü","b","e","r"," ","d","i","e"," ","U","n","t","e","r","s","c","h","i","e","d","e"," ","z","w","i","s","c","h","e","n"," ","i","h","n","e","n"," ","v","e","r","m","u","t",